    },
    {
      "id": "6a72f81b0000000000ba5a6f",
      "text": "[hoagecko.icon]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785919515,
      "updated": 1785919517
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72f81d0000000000ba5a71",
      "text": " [https://sh.itjust.works/post/64598666 TIL “ROOTS66,” a Japanese music festival open exclusively to musicians born in 1966—a year considered an “unlucky year” - sh.itjust.works]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785919517,
      "updated": 1785919523
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72f8230000000000ba5a72",
      "text": " \t[ROOTS66]を海外の掲示板(Lemmy)に紹介してきた",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785919524,
      "updated": 1785919559
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72f8470000000000ba5a73",
      "text": " \t会場が毎日の会館だった関係で毎日の英字版が報道していた",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785919559,
      "updated": 1785919603
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72f8580000000000ba5a74",
      "text": " \t\tちなみにこの会館も1966年建設だったりする",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785919577,
      "updated": 1785931690
    },
    {
      "id": "6a733a8600000000003bba4b",
      "text": " [https://hoagecko.hatenablog.com/entry/the-jazz-sensation-of-modern-japan 戦前ジャズ「受け手」史 - 近代日本のジャズセンセーション: 青木学 - hoageckoのブログ]",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785936518,
      "updated": 1785936519
    },
    {
      "id": "6a733a8a00000000003bba4c",
      "text": " \t投稿した",
      "userId": "688c296691686a314f82fb52",
      "created": 1785936522,
      "updated": 1785936525
    },
    {
      "id": "6a72fc8500000000002d8b61",
